
# TNeGA Law Application Portal

A modern web-based application portal built using React and Tailwind CSS for managing and viewing law-related applications efficiently.

## Features

* Create new applications
* View submitted applications
* Delete applications
* Responsive and clean UI
* Local storage support for saving application data
* Fast and lightweight frontend

## Tech Stack

* React.js
* Tailwind CSS
* React Router DOM
* JavaScript (ES6)

## Project Structure

```bash
src/
│
├── components/      # Reusable UI components
├── pages/           # Application pages
├── utils/           # Utility and local storage functions
├── styles/          # Global styles
└── App.js           # Main app component
```

## Installation

Clone the repository:

```bash
git clone <repository-url>
```

Navigate to the project folder:

```bash
cd tnega-law/frontend
```

Install dependencies:

```bash
npm install
```

Start the development server:

```bash
npm start
```

The application will run on:

```bash
http://localhost:3000
```

## Available Scripts

### Start Development Server

```bash
npm start
```

### Build for Production

```bash
npm run build
```

### Run Tests

```bash
npm test
```

## Functionalities

### Home Page

* Displays all submitted applications
* View and delete actions available

### New Application

* Submit application details through forms
* Stores data locally

### Application View

* Displays complete application details

## UI Design

* Built with Tailwind CSS utility classes
* Responsive table layout
* Styled buttons and forms
* Mobile-friendly interface

